  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental peace-making in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental peace building in Somalia: Integrating environmental and peace building challenges as entry points for Federal and State political dialogue and reconciliation   The overall objective is to enhance political dialogue and reconciliation by identifying environmental challenges that impact on conflict, ensuring that efforts to resolve conflict properly address the issues and at the same time, maximize the opportunities to secure sustainable agreements, including from a gender-responsive perspective.</narrative>
  </description>
